(:include "tiers/melee.domain")
(:include "tiers/idle.domain")

// Hostile mob: attack the best target in reach of its senses, else idle. The simplest hostile root.
//
// Teaches: the melee tier's fix-up ladder (unbuckle / break free / escape before the attack, one fix per plan),
// the same two-branch shape as the mouse with another tier on top, guards on every root branch (see mouse.domain).
// Source: Space Station 14 (MIT), `SimpleHostileCompound` in Resources/Prototypes/NPCs/mob.yml and `XenoCompound`
// in xeno.yml (both melee > idle) at commit 614f030530578e248a2393dd71ee9813d68d800d:
// https://github.com/space-wizards/space-station-14/blob/614f030530578e248a2393dd71ee9813d68d800d/Resources/Prototypes/NPCs/mob.yml
// Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2017-2026 Space Wizards Federation; see src/examples/canon/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
// Adapted (YAML prototypes re-written in our domain language).
// Deviations: guards on the root branches.
// Not ported: `SimpleHumanoidHostileCompound` in root.yml (ranged > melee > idle: needs the gun tier).
//
// Facts and primitives: see tiers/melee.domain and tiers/idle.domain.

(:domain HostileMob top_level_domain

    (:method (behave) top_level_method

        (fight
            (and
                (#melee_target ?target)
            )
            (
                (melee ?target)
            )
        )

        (idle
            ()
            (
                (idle)
            )
        )
    )
)
